@startuml Booking Flow - Clinic -> Service -> Date/Time -> Details -> Review -> Confirm
!theme plain
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam shadowing false

actor User
boundary "Main App\n(MainView + Navigator)" as MainUI
control "MainController" as MainC

boundary "Clinic Search" as ClinicUI
control "ClinicSearchController/Service" as ClinicC

boundary "Service Selection" as ServiceUI
control "BookingController" as BookingC

boundary "Date & Time" as DateTimeUI
control "DateTimeSelector + TimeslotProvider" as SlotPicker
entity "Service/Timeslot DAO" as SlotDAO

boundary "Personal Info / Details" as DetailsUI
boundary "Review" as ReviewUI

entity "BookingService" as BookingS
entity "AppointmentDAO/DB" as AppointmentDB
control "NotificationDispatcher" as Dispatch
control "BookingCommunicationPrefs" as CommPrefs
entity "EmailSender" as Mail
boundary "In-app Notification" as Notif

== Open Booking ==
User -> MainUI: Click "Book"
MainUI -> MainC: goToBooking()
MainC -> ClinicUI: show clinic search

== Choose Clinic ==
User -> ClinicUI: Search + select clinic
ClinicUI -> ClinicC: search/select
ClinicC --> ClinicUI: results + selection
ClinicUI -> BookingC: setClinic(clinic)
BookingC -> ServiceUI: show service selection

== Choose Service(s) ==
User -> ServiceUI: pick service(s)
ServiceUI -> BookingC: add service items
BookingC -> DateTimeUI: show date/time step

== Pick Timeslot(s) ==
User -> DateTimeUI: choose date
DateTimeUI -> SlotPicker: update available times
SlotPicker -> SlotDAO: get available dates + timeslots
SlotDAO --> SlotPicker: available dates + timeslots
User -> DateTimeUI: choose time slot
DateTimeUI -> SlotPicker: onSelect(slot)
SlotPicker -> BookingC: set timeslotId/date/time on booking items
User -> DateTimeUI: Next
DateTimeUI -> BookingC: goToDetails()

== Enter Details ==
User -> DetailsUI: enter notes/personal info
DetailsUI -> BookingC: update booking details
User -> DetailsUI: Next
DetailsUI -> BookingC: goToReview()
BookingC -> ReviewUI: show booking summary

== Confirm Booking ==
User -> ReviewUI: Confirm
ReviewUI -> BookingC: confirmBooking()
BookingC -> BookingS: confirmBooking(booking, userId)
BookingS -> AppointmentDB: insert Appointment(s)\nreserve capacity
AppointmentDB --> BookingS: ok

group Transactional confirmation (if enabled)
  BookingC -> CommPrefs: load(userId)
  CommPrefs --> BookingC: discreet + template overrides
  BookingC -> Dispatch: notifyUser(userId,\nBookingConfirmationEmail,\nBookingConfirmationNotification)
  Dispatch -> Mail: send email (if configured)
  Dispatch -> Notif: show in-app notification
end

BookingC --> MainUI: Navigate to "Booking confirmed" prompt\n(reminders or skip)

@enduml
